[{"id":1266109909256544256,"date":1590699100000,"rawContent":"The silence of white folks is deafening. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":168842600,"media":null,"username":"RandiCynamon","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":19,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1268906701849333760,"date":1591365907000,"rawContent":"2020 is doing exactly what it needs to do. Opening eyes &amp; showing ppl what\u2019s really going on...even  if they\u2019ve been willfully ignorant. It\u2019s time for all of us to learn &amp; do better. Honor YOUR highest good. #Protest #Write #Advocate #Donate #Educate #BlackLivesMatter","userId":168842600,"media":null,"username":"RandiCynamon","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":20,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1270092146071285763,"date":1591648539000,"rawContent":"We deserve to Live In Peace. Not just Rest In Peace. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":168842600,"media":null,"username":"RandiCynamon","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":21,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1273313394574200834,"date":1592416544000,"rawContent":"If I see or hear one more person say the system is broken I\u2019m gonna scream. The system is not broken. It was carefully and intentionally designed to do exactly what it has been doing for the past 400+ years. It just keeps evolving into something more sinister and cruel. #BLM","userId":168842600,"media":null,"username":"RandiCynamon","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1273336750375567360,"date":1592422113000,"rawContent":"They\u2019re wearing kente cloth stoles, changing logos on racist products, making Juneteenth a  paid holiday but have yet to fire\/arrest Breonna Taylor\u2019s murderers. All that other stuff is a bandaid on an infected wound.  Spare me theatrics and show some legal accountability. #BLM","userId":168842600,"media":null,"username":"RandiCynamon","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":23,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1281639868288950273,"date":1594401730000,"rawContent":"\u201cNobody cares if you can\u2019t dance well. Just get up and dance. Great dancers are not great because of their technique, they are great because of their passion.\u201d \u2013 Martha Graham\n\nSong: Better Days- Le\u2019Andria Johnson\n#BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/Z4RKTbQHjp","userId":168842600,"media":[{"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video_thumb\/1281639376666189826\/pu\/img\/xroAwOgncYId6lSS.jpg","variants":["https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video\/1281639376666189826\/pu\/vid\/360x640\/MO7P-xd0N2796jzc.mp4?tag=10","https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/ext_tw_video\/1281639376666189826\/pu\/pl\/RT5W9FJZKQzIq